00:34:24.300 --> 00:34:27.300
I don't have a huge amount
of like anime manga friends

00:34:27.300 --> 00:34:29.940
in my sort of like age group.

00:34:29.940 --> 00:34:31.890
And I really appreciate
that you always like,

00:34:31.890 --> 00:34:32.940
