and still just loves me

00:35:07.890 --> 00:35:09.240
and is ride or die.

00:35:09.240 --> 00:35:12.270
And I think she and my friend Lizla,

00:35:12.270 --> 00:35:16.590
sort of showed me that I am
deserving of love, and care,

00:35:16.590 --> 00:35:18.210
and consideration, and friendship,

00:35:18.210 --> 00:35:20.310
even when I am at my worst,

00:35:20.310 --> 00:35:24.030
